153 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/ActualText (Campus placements mark the culmination of a tedious four-year journey for students pursuing undergraduate programmes at IITs. Typically, campus placements unfold in two phases, starting from June-July the previous year and concluding by April-May in the current one. However, the current hiring season has witnessed subdued activity compared to the previous years. And it's not just the case for newer IITs. While the top 7 IITs hold greater significance due to their enduring legacy, the placement situation has looked bleak in both older and newer IITs, given they face the same job market challenges.)
/Pg 8 0 R
/K [3]
>>
endobj
