158 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/ActualText (According to a news report, one of the reasons for the decrease in placements could be the continuous dilution in the level of entrance exam as well as the major chunk of students joining through reservations\(around 50%\). Obviously the marks scored in an entrance exam do not decide how a student performs in placements, however, an easier path in joining the college may lead to a false sense of safety and lack of motivation within them considering that in the past it was regular for the majority to get good job offers. According to Shantanu Rooj, CEO of TeamLease Edtech, IT majors have traditionally been the highest recruiters from IITs. However, global uncertainties and lower demand from the US clients have compelled them to hire a lesser number of freshers this year. Advancements in AI, Machine Learning \(ML\) and Data Science have helped many organisations to automate lower-level tasks, and several other tasks are being outsourced to GenAI platforms, thereby reducing the demand for fresh talent.)
/Pg 8 0 R
/K [4]
>>
endobj
