/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/ActualText (The Israel-Hamas war, now waging in its 9 th month, and a part of the greater Israeli-Palestinian conflict raging since decades, has become one of the darkest events in the history of humanity. Sadly, it is not a page in our history textbooks that we can reminisce about and turn over, it is happening right now.)
/Pg 14 0 R
/K [7]
>>
endobj
